msgstr "Proyectos de Breadslicer"

#: src/scene_save.rs
msgctxt "ErrorDialog"
msgid ""
"Project files are saved as .bread files. To save a 3MF project, use Save As "
"3MF."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos de proyecto se guardan como archivos .bread. Para guardar un "
"proyecto 3MF, usá Guardar como 3MF."

#: src/scene_loader.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "Supports not restored"
msgstr "Soportes no restaurados"

#: src/scene_loader.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid ""
"The project opened, but its supports could not be rebuilt and were left out. "
"Generate them again."
msgstr ""
"El proyecto se abrió, pero sus soportes no se pudieron reconstruir y se "
"dejaron afuera. Volvé a generarlos."

#: src/scene_save.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "Supports saved as a mesh"
msgstr "Soportes guardados como malla"

#: src/scene_save.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "The scene has more than one set of supports, so they were saved as a mesh: they will open, but cannot be edited by hand. Keep one set and save again to keep them editable."
msgstr "La escena tiene más de un juego de soportes, así que se guardaron como malla: se van a abrir, pero no se van a poder editar a mano. Dejá un solo juego y guardá de nuevo para que sigan siendo editables."

#: src/scene_save.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "These supports no longer match the models (or were opened as a mesh), so they were saved as a mesh: they will open, but cannot be edited by hand. Generate them again and save to keep them editable."
msgstr "Estos soportes ya no coinciden con los modelos (o se abrieron como malla), así que se guardaron como malla: se van a abrir, pero no se van a poder editar a mano. Generalos de nuevo y guardá para que sigan siendo editables."

#: src/scene_save.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "These supports cannot be kept as data, so they were saved as a mesh: they will open, but cannot be edited by hand."
msgstr "Estos soportes no se pueden guardar como datos, así que se guardaron como malla: se van a abrir, pero no se van a poder editar a mano."

#: src/df_support_run.rs
msgctxt "DfSupportDialog"
msgid "These supports were opened as a mesh, so they cannot be edited by hand. Generate supports again to edit them."
msgstr "Estos soportes se abrieron como malla, así que no se pueden editar a mano. Generá soportes de nuevo para editarlos."

